f the screen.\n\t+ The button is highlighted in red, indicating that the user's account is currently locked.\n\n**Summary**\n\nThe image shows a screenshot of the CoreID Admin Console, displaying user information for A. Rao, who is an L1 Support - Password Reset Admin. The user's account is currently locked, as indicated by the red \"Locked\" button.\n\n**Detailed Description**\n\n* The CoreID Admin Console is displayed on the left side of the screen, with a dark blue background and white text.\n* The menu options are: Admin Console, Dashboard, Tickets, Users, Reports, and Settings.\n* The user's name is A. Rao, and their role is L1 Support - Password Reset Admin.\n* The user's ID is SOL-04821.\n* There is a red button labeled \"Locked\" in the bottom-right corner of the screen, indicating that the user's account is currently locked.\n\n**Extracted Text**\n\n* None\n\n**Errors and Warnings**\n\n* None visible\n\n**Likely Issue Category and Severity**\n\n* Category: Account/authentication\n* Severity: Medium\n* Reason: The user's account is currently locked, which may indicate an issue with their authentication or account status.\n\n**Observed Facts vs Inference**\n\n* OBSERVED FACTS:\n\t+ The user's name is A. Rao.\n\t+ Their role is L1 Support - Password Reset Admin.\n\t+ The user's ID is SOL-04821.\n\t+ The account is currently locked.\n* INFERENCE:\n\t+ The user may be experiencing issues with their account or authentication.\n\t+ The locked status may be due to a password reset or other security measure.\n\n**Confidence Score and Notes**\n\n* CONFIDENCE SCORE: 0.95\n* CONFIDENCE LEVEL: High\n* CONFIDENCE REASON: The image is clear and well-lit, with no visible issues with text legibility or context.\n\nStep 3: Caller identity verified\nNavigation: CoreID Admin Console → user profile → Identity Verification panel\nAsk the caller for at least 2 of: employee ID, manager's name, department, or last 4 digits of the phone on file. ✅ Do not send a one-time code to the 